n top of the normal volume. Tom can confirm.

Saturday vs third shift: our dock doors and the pick zones are already fully =
used in the two weekday shifts, a third shift would not add door capacity but=
 Saturday does. Saturday also lets us catch up on the backlog before the Mond=
ay carrier pickups. A night shift would cost more because of the higher night=
 premium and we would need extra supervision. So Saturday shifts with the 25 =
temps is the cheapest way to cover the +35%.

